WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 4.2 · People, Culture & Volunteers
Recruitment and fair selection

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Your first role sets the standard: recruit fairly, beyond friends and contacts, from day one.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Drop requirements the work does not really need.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Agree criteria and scoring before reading applications.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Add safer recruitment steps if roles involve children.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You design the recruitment process for your first or next role.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
